<title>USA: Able Telcom buys Dial for $4.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Able Telcom buys Dial for $4.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Able Telcom Holding Corp said on Tuesday that it bought Dial Communications Inc for $4.6 million in cash, a seller's note, and 108,000 shares of Able's restricted common stock.</p>
<p>Dial Communications, which is a Tallahassee, Fla.-based provider of advanced telecommunication network services, expects to contribute revenues, on an annualized basis, in excess of $12 million in fiscal year 1997, it said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
